  "question": {
    "text": "If the function\n$f(x)= \\begin{cases}\\frac{72^x-9^x-8^x+1}{\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{1+\\cos x}}, & x \\neq 0 \\\\ a \\log _e 2 \\log _e 3 & , x=0\\end{cases}$\nis continuous at $x=0$, then the value of $a^2$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "nZmE5",
